where \(\Lambda({\bf q},{\bf p},{\bf k})=(Zt\gamma_{{\bf k}-{\bf p}}-Zt^{\prime}\gamma^ {\prime}_{{\bf k}-{\bf p}})^{2}+(Zt\gamma_{{\bf q}+{\bf p}+{\bf k}}-Zt^{\prime} \gamma^{\prime}_{{\bf q}+{\bf p}+{\bf k}})^{2}\), \(\bar{\Delta}_{hZ}({\bf k})=Z_{hF}\bar{\Delta}_{h}({\bf k})\), the charge carrier quasiparticle quasiparticle spectrum \(E_{h{\bf k}}=\sqrt{\bar{\xi}_{\bf k}^{2}+|\bar{\Delta}_{hZ}({\bf k})|^{2}}\), \(\bar{\xi}_{\bf k}=Z_{hF}\xi_{\bf k}\), \(\bar{\Delta}_{h}({\bf k})=\bar{\Delta}_{h}^{(d)}\) is the effective charge carrier gap function in the d-wave symmetry with \(\gamma^{(d)}_{\bf k}=({\rm cos}k_{x}-{\rm cos}k_{y})/2\), \(F_{1}^{(\nu)}({\bf k},{\bf p},{\bf q})=n_{B}(\omega_{{\bf q}+{\bf k}}^{(\nu)})[ n_{F}(E_{{\bf p}})-n_{F}(E_{{\bf p}+{\bf q}})]\) - \(n_{F}(-E_{{\bf p}})n_{F}(E_{{\bf p}+{\bf q}})\), \(F_{2}^{(\nu)}({\bf k},{\bf p},{\bf q})=n_{B}(\omega_{{\bf q}+{\bf k}}^{(\nu)})[ n_{F}(E_{{\bf p}+{\bf q}})-n_{F}(E_{{\bf p}+{\bf q}})]\)

